docs/IPFS_DATASETS_PY_BATCH1_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md:322:That slice had the highest leverage because provenance normalization was stable enough that the main remaining Batch 1 risk was archived-page corpus behavior drifting into an evidence-adjacent special case. Archived-page storage, support packets, and fact-backed review semantics are now covered more explicitly, so the remaining leverage is in keeping the broader cross-source fact contract enforced and documented without prematurely pulling in Batch 2 or graph-store redesign work.
