docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:3286:- `follow_up_focus="temporal_gap_closure"` and `query_strategy="temporal_gap_targeted"` identify chronology-closure tasks that exist because legal timing is still insufficient, not because generic support is missing.
