docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:3405:- `optimization_max_iterations`, `optimization_target_score`, `optimization_provider`, and `optimization_model_name`: optional controls for the refinement loop and routed LLM selection.
docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:3406:- `optimization_llm_config`: optional object. Passes provider-specific routed LLM settings such as a Hugging Face router `base_url`, headers, or timeouts when the optimizer should override the default router configuration.
docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:3407:- `optimization_persist_artifacts`: optional boolean. When `true`, the optimization trace is stored through the IPFS adapter and the response exposes the resulting CID.
