docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:3983:- `document_builder_summary` is produced by the document API after artifact and review-link annotation. It is optimized for browser and CLI consumers that need a compact filing-readiness overview: section support status counts, per-section source/gap counts, rolled-up source-family and artifact-family counts, W10.2 guardrail warning/blocker counts, guardrail warning-type counts, managed artifact download provenance, and document grounding metrics.
